c:16:2 down:KeyD wait:600\" --seed 1\n```\n\nOpen `game/index.html` in a browser to play (or serve the folder: `npx serve`). To hand a single file to a person, inline\nthe two scripts into the page.\n\n## Testing a game without a browser\n\n`new E.Game()` is headless in Node (or with `{ headless: true }`): no screen, sound or DOM, and `draw` is skipped.\n\n- `game.advance(seconds)` runs exact fixed steps of 1/120 s at once: `advance(1)` is 120 updates.\n- `game.input.tap('jump')` presses an action for one step, `hold('right')` holds one down, `hold('right', false)` lets go.\n- `game.debug = { snapshot() { return {...} }, teleport(x, y, z) {...} }` is your game's handle: tests read it, and\n  `tools/check.mjs` and `tools/replay.mjs` print it.\n- `game.stop()`, `game.start()` and `game.dispose()` stop, resume and end a game.\n\nThe same inputs give the same game on every machine and at every refresh rate: the clock is an exact fixed step.\ne/dist/handoff/game:\ngame.js\nindex.html\ntest.mjs\n\ne/dist/handoff/kits:\nREADME.md\nadventure.html\nadventure.js\nanimlab.html\nanimlab.js\narcade.html\narcade.js\nartillery.html\nartillery.js\nbrawler.html\nbrawler.js\nfighting.html\nfighting.js\nkart.html\nkart.js\nmetroidvania.html\nmetroidvania.js\npinball.html\npinball.js\nplatformer.html\nplatformer.js\npointclick.html\npointclick.js\npuzzle.html\npuzzle.js\nrhythm.html\nrhythm.js\nroad.html\nroad.js\nroguelike.html\nroguelike.js\nrpg.html\nrpg.js\nrts.html\nrts.js\nshooter.html\nshooter.js\nsim.html\nsim.js\nsports.html\nsports.js\nstealth.html\nstealth.js\ntactics.html\ntactics.js\ntest.mjs\n\ne/dist/handoff/tools:\nasset-find.mjs\nasset-lib.mjs\nasset-set.mjs\nasset-sheet.mjs\ncheck.mjs\nfilmstrip.mjs\nreplay.mjs\n\nh/lib/hub/examples:\narena.html\nghost.html\nparallel.html","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050226__x7910ab/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_r