: seconds played in the\n3820:    this.canSave = true; this.played = 0; this.blocked = false;\n3913:  if (g.saves.canSave) acts.push(['Save', () => g.saves.show('save')]);\n131:- Adjust: `new E.Game({ menu: { items: [['Restart', fn]], settings: [{ key: 'hints', label: 'Hints', value: true }, { key: 'difficulty', options: ['Easy', 'Normal', 'Hard'], value: 'Normal' }], controls: { attack: 'Sword', skill: false }, quit: 'title' } })`, then read `game.settings.hints`. Leave parts out: `menu: false` (your own pause), `fullscreen: 'button' | false`, `corner: false`, `backGesture: false`, `autoPause: false`. `game.cornerArea()`: where the corner's buttons cover the screen (or null): keep a HUD clear of it.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HcygYsPkBSrrQwpBxhWQ32","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
