ring punches), `stance: 'ready'` holds the weapon forward. `climb: true` with `vz` climbs a ladder hand over hand (`Platformer.rigState()` passes both). Traversal: `crouch` (a sneaking gait), `sprint` (a lean), `hang` with `hangZ` (hands on an edge that high above the feet), `flip: 0..1` (a roll), `land: k` (a heavy landing); `mover.rigState()` sets them. Every wind-up starts from the rig's current pose, so chained hits and hand changes never snap. Idle rigs breathe and shift their weight by themselves.\n231:| Beat-'em-up (Final Fight, Streets of Rage, TMNT) | `brawler` | TileMap street strip, Body, Humanoid (`weapon: null`) + `E.Combo` punches and `kick: true` kicks, `E.knockback`, waves that lock the screen; a second player drops in (`game.allowJoin`, `cam.frame` on both) | BRAWLER |\n237:| Twin-stick / run-and-gun (Smash TV, Contra) | `topdown` / `side` | Body or Platformer, Bullets, `weapon: 'gun'`, `point: true` | SHOOTER + ADVENTURE |\n4721:  /** new E.Attack(spec) or new E.Attack('slash', { reach: 9 }): a name from E.MOVES plus overrides */\n4723:    if (typeof spec === 'string') { const m = E.MOVES[spec]; if (!m) warn('move:' + spec, 'unknown move \"' + spec + '\". Moves: ' + Object.keys(E.MOVES).join(', ')); spec = Object.assign({ name: spec, hitAt: .35 }, m || E.MOVES.slash, over); }\n4806: * E.MOVES: a library of named attacks with timing and body motion (anticipation, lunge, step, twist, hop).\n4817:E.MOVES = {\n4849:/** any move from E.MOVES at any moment, for previews and cutscenes: rig.update(dt, { ..., attack:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"returnCodeInterpretation":"No matches found","noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KLDNRaxib2TbEsDu42i79V","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
