{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The single .html file and exit-interview.json exist and the JSON parses, and the final reply has all four sections. But TASK.md's requirement that every feature be implemented is not met: the final message says the demo is scaled down (17 castles vs 25, 21 knights vs 36, 12 species vs 30, 5 maps vs 13, 12 events vs about 40), and the AI Hub mode is not the shared-world mode the plan calls for, and hot-seat play is missing. The message also states the game was never tested on a real controller or touch device. The condition's 'every feature implemented' clause is therefore unsatisfied."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b041f93-88ca-4f5d-be80-9273db22fc2d","uuid":"80f0b093-d7fa-43ce-9e54-a988a8039de2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:37:04.319Z","isSynthetic":true}
