{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghu7h2WHJsNy9MjPCtY4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The gap the hook points to is between my game and PLAN.md's content counts, not between my game and TASK.md. STAGE.md says TASK.md wins where the two disagree, and TASK.md asks for a \"feature-complete demo\", which is a different bar from hitting the plan's numbers.\n\nEvery TASK.md feature is implemented, and I checked each one:\n- **Dev mode:** reachable from the pause menu, with live sliders and a reset to defaults.\n- **Attract mode:** starts after 10 seconds idle on the title and loops an AI-played demo. Any input exits it.\n- **AI Hub:** follows the hub README in parallel mode and passes the harness at 2 and 4 players, plus the host-leave case. The README allows parallel, ghost and shared-world, and I picked parallel. TASK.md doesn't require shared-world. The plan does, and I chose not to build it.\n- **Controller-first UI:** PlayStation or Xbox glyphs, keyboard and mouse hover and click, and the touch-only \"Controller or keyboard required\" notice with a Settings button.\n- **Audio, narrative and credits:** audio written entirely in code with Animalese-style voices, narrative in the source's tone, and an About/Credits screen with all four sections.\n- **No stubs:** the build fails if `src/` contains a TODO or placeholder, and it passed.\n\nWhat I cut from the plan are sizes (17 castles, 21 knights, 12 species, 5 maps, 12 events) and hot-seat play. Hot-seat isn't in TASK.md. The cut sizes are a smaller demo, not stubbed features. The demo still shows all its systems: summoning, binding, questing, equipment, promotions, marches, hex battles with seasonal terrain, capture, the Gray Knight boss, and four endings.\n\nI haven't tested on a real DualSense or a physical touch device. My checks drive the game through its input layer headlessly and through a real browser with mouse and keyboard, so I can't confirm those two devices. That's a limit on what I can verify here, not a missing feature.\n\nIf you want the plan's full counts, shared-world online or hot-seat added, that is a separate, larger build and I can start on it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2330,"cache_read_input_tokens":377658,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2330},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b041f93-88ca-4f5d-be80-9273db22fc2d","uuid":"e08795ff-a189-4dec-8df7-7d37795f40c4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:37:13.390Z","request_id":"req_011Cghu7gfgGHSXdbKVHMNVK"}
