{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghu8XbkiRTx8BwdsKc6a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't close this gap without a much larger build, and I won't claim it is closed.\n\nPLAN.md's content scope is not met. It asks for 25 castles, 36 knights, 30 species, 13 maps and about 40 events, plus a shared-world AI Hub mode and hot-seat play. I built 17 castles, 21 knights, 12 species, 5 maps and 12 events, with parallel-mode AI Hub play and no hot-seat. These are smaller amounts of content, not stubs.\n\nI read \"where they disagree, TASK.md wins\" as meaning TASK.md sets what counts as feature-complete. Every system and feature TASK.md names works, and the build rules out TODOs and placeholders in the source. If the intended bar is the plan's counts and modes, then the work is not done, and I'd be misleading you to say it is.\n\nClosing the gap would mean at least these:\n- about 10 more castles\n- about 15 more knights\n- 18 more species with 3 forms each\n- 8 more maps\n- about 28 more story events\n- a hot-seat mode\n- a shared-world version of the online mode\n\nThat's a full second build, not a patch. Each piece would need its own balance and test pass.\n\nI also haven't tested a real DualSense or a physical touch device. My checks cover the input layer headlessly and a real browser with mouse and keyboard.\n\nI'm stopping here rather than looping. The deliverables, the four report sections, and the passing checks (254 headless checks plus the AI Hub harness) stand as reported. If you want the full plan scope, tell me and I'll start that build as a new task."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1537,"cache_read_input_tokens":379988,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1537},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b041f93-88ca-4f5d-be80-9273db22fc2d","uuid":"bb264c86-00b2-4b2a-afe1-fbfe7eadd1de","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:37:24.735Z","request_id":"req_011Cghu8XGfY5ZWZHTCkkV6j"}
