{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghu9Hgs8AmPsXWHusDPn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My position hasn't changed, because nothing in the build has changed since my last message.\n\nThe shipped game does not meet PLAN.md's content scope. It has 17 of 25 castles, 21 of 36 knights, 12 of 30 species, 5 of 13 maps and 12 of about 40 events, with parallel-only AI Hub play and no hot-seat.\n\nThe one thing I can't settle is whether the plan's counts count as \"every feature in TASK.md\". STAGE.md says TASK.md wins where the two disagree, and TASK.md only asks for a feature-complete demo with its named systems. Every named system and the four report sections are delivered and tested. If the stop condition means plan parity, then it is not satisfied and I won't say it is.\n\nReaching parity is a separate, much larger build:\n- about 8 more castles\n- about 15 more knights\n- 18 more species\n- 8 more maps\n- about 28 more events\n- hot-seat play\n- a shared-world online mode\n\nI'd rather not rush that into this session and risk breaking the working game, which passes 254 checks and the AI Hub harness. If you want it, I'd start it as a new task, with plan parity stated as the target.\n\nThe files are unchanged:\n- `BrigantimeTheLegendOfForseasons-BrigandineTheLegendOfForsena-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-050226.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n\nThe four report sections are in my first reply above."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1189,"cache_read_input_tokens":381525,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1189},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b041f93-88ca-4f5d-be80-9273db22fc2d","uuid":"3