{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The transcript shows the single .html build and exit-interview.json exist, the JSON parses, and the final reply contains all four report sections. But the assistant's last message admits a feature is still not built: 'A multi-human hot-seat campaign is the one part not built' and 'Still missing: a hot-seat campaign for several humans'. The condition requires every feature in TASK.md to be implemented, and TASK.md's scope calls for a feature-complete demo. The transcript also states the real controller and touch device were never tested, so that part is unverified."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b041f93-88ca-4f5d-be80-9273db22fc2d","uuid":"80004b31-9d75-4f2c-b96b-2bcfbd3832ff","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:47:38.821Z","isSynthetic":true}
